cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this notebook, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Batch Download of DraCor Data with a Provenance Record"
abstract: "A Jupyter notebook that downloads data of many plays of a DraCor corpus at once (networks, characters, spoken text, stage directions, TEI) with PyDraCor, and writes a provenance record with the DraCor IDs of the plays and the commit of the corpus version."
